# CommitBrief UI release public key (Ed25519, standard base64 of the 32 key bytes).
#
# This file is embedded in the binary and is the only trust anchor of the
# self-update (UI-0007): a release is accepted only when its checksums.txt carries
# a signature that verifies under one of the keys listed here. While no key line is
# present the updater refuses every update (fail-closed). One line per key; a
# second line exists only while a key is being rotated.
#
# The maintainer fills it in once, see docs/RELEASING.md:
#   go run scripts/sign-checksums.go keygen
# stores the private half as the UPDATE_ED25519_PRIVATE_KEY secret and pastes the
# public line below. Never put the private key anywhere in the repository.
